  "description": "Solar Charge Controller 20A, 12V/24V Intelligent Battery... - Distributed/Packaged by Techtonics. Product Details: Solar Charge Controller 20A, 12V/24V Intelligent Battery... - Distributed/Packaged by Techtonics. Product Details: Solar Charge Controller 20A, 12V/24V Intelligent Battery Regulator for Lead Acid & Lithium Battery with LCD Display and USB Port - Distributed/Packaged by Techtonics. Product Details: When a connection is made between a battery and a solar panel, it regulates battery charging. You can view the charging status on the LCD. The controller will protect your battery and lengthen its life with overload, short circuit, open-circuit, and reverse protection. All types of batteries are compatible with this updated controller. Choose the appropriate battery type, such as B1 for lead-acid, B2 for lithium-ion, or B3 for lithium-polymer. The controller should be connected to the battery before the panel. Connections must be made in this order for the controller to function. Only a 12V battery can power a 12V panel, while a 24V panel needs a 24V battery. You can choose the work mode, float voltage, discharge reconnect, and discharge stop.",
